00:41:48.360 --> 00:41:51.140
really mean to get in touch, and then five years go by.

1045
00:41:51.340 --> 00:41:51.880
Well, yeah.

1046
00:41:52.000 --> 00:41:53.820
It's just, you know, you do.

1047
00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:54.980
That's the beauty of it.

1048
00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:56.700
All right.

1049
00:41:56.880 --> 00:41:59.100
Well, here are our call sheet questions.

