Not really.

1068
00:42:51.750 --> 00:42:52.810
Or were you, like, full-on faking it?

1069
00:42:52.810 --> 00:42:53.890
I was faking it.

1070
00:42:53.950 --> 00:42:54.110
Okay.

1071
00:42:54.110 --> 00:42:54.890
I was faking it.

1072
00:42:54.890 --> 00:42:56.790
You were hitting the Long Beach club scene?

1073
